  "pseudocode": "scale = 0.5*(scale_parent_cost + scale_parent_plain)\nmargin = alpha*scale*(lpw-lpl) - cost_weight*detach(cost_b-cost_a)\nloss = -logsigmoid(clamp(margin, -20, 20))\nreturn mean(weight*loss if weight else loss)",
